        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "The manufacturer information postal address, indicating a single contact point. Web address, if available; and web address, if available. \n\n\nDIN DKE Spec 99100 chapter reference: 6.1.2.3\n\n\nNote: This is drop-in of the ContactInformation Submodel"
